{"schemaVersion":1,"id":99,"sections":[{"id":"130004-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20717],"start":0,"count":18},{"id":"130004-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20718],"start":18,"count":10},{"id":"130005-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[20719],"start":28,"count":14},{"id":"130005-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[20720],"start":42,"count":11},{"id":"130006-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[20721],"start":53,"count":26},{"id":"130006-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[20722],"start":79,"count":15}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:1","scriptId":20717,"text":"由于任务进行的非常顺利，花费的时间少了一半，于是众人打算提前回死水基地。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:2","scriptId":20717,"text":"然而一个惊人的消息打断了原本的计划，本地区的机场目前被一群战车兽骚扰，运输机无法起降。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:3","scriptId":20717,"text":"“我们负责清理战车兽，你们趁机坐运输机离开好了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":null,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:4","scriptId":20717,"text":"“不不不，这怎么好意思，反正只是普通的战车兽，我们一起帮忙处理好了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:5","scriptId":20717,"text":"“好吧，那我们就一起出击，让机场的损失降到最小。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:6","scriptId":20717,"text":"“没问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:8","scriptId":20717,"text":"到达机场的一处高台，从这里可以鸟瞰整个机场。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:9","scriptId":20717,"text":"“战车兽还挺多的嘛……机场守备正在奋力抵抗。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:10","scriptId":20717,"text":"“靠近机场入口有一批战车兽的增援，我们小队过去截断它们。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:11","scriptId":20717,"text":"“好的，我们来清理机场内部。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:12","scriptId":20717,"text":"伊莎贝尔带着她的小队快速赶往机场入口。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:13","scriptId":20717,"text":"从高台上观察整个机场的情况后，对佩妮和奈特莉还有芙琳下达了简单的指示。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:14","scriptId":20717,"text":"“机场出现的战车兽里好像有种鸵鸟，和往常的战车兽不同，比较灵活，你们注意应对。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:15","scriptId":20717,"text":"“嗯，鸵鸟战车兽好像不是本地的品种……我也是第一次看到。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:16","scriptId":20717,"text":"“正面冲刺速度极快，如果被它们撞到后果无法想象。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:17","scriptId":20717,"text":"“让我来吧，虽说是备用舞装，但装甲的坚固度并不比以前的那套逊色，可以试着拦截一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:18","scriptId":20717,"text":"“不行！撞击的伤害主要来自冲击波，即使钢舞姬能够抵御撞击的伤害，冲击波造成的体内损伤不可估量。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-PROLOGUE:20717:19","scriptId":20717,"text":"“好吧，那只能尽量打提前量来捕捉鸵鸟们的行动的了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130004-EPILOGUE:20718:0","scriptId":20718,"text":"大部分的战车兽都很容易处理，通过和机场守卫进行配合，清理起来很有效率。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-EPILOGUE:20718:1","scriptId":20718,"text":"“感觉这套舞装的性能我已经全部掌握了，对身体的负担挺大的，适合当决战兵器。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":1188,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-EPILOGUE:20718:2","scriptId":20718,"text":"“佩妮好厉害，还好我在选择备用舞装时，就选了套各项指标都差不多的，不然还真担心短时间内无法掌握呢！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":1188,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130004-EPILOGUE:20718:3","scriptId":20718,"text":"已知型号的战车兽大都有对应的战术策略，只要按部就班的处理，基本都能轻松应对。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":1188,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-EPILOGUE:20718:4","scriptId":20718,"text":"“这鸵鸟的机动力很高啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-EPILOGUE:20718:5","scriptId":20718,"text":"“是的，是第一次见到的类型，没有特别好的对应方法。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-EPILOGUE:20718:6","scriptId":20718,"text":"“只能先把它放一边，处理完其他的战车兽再想办法对付它。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":1188,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-EPILOGUE:20718:7","scriptId":20718,"text":"“那奈特莉你负责去引开它。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":1188,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130004-EPILOGUE:20718:8","scriptId":20718,"text":"“好吧……这种重任就也只能交给我了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":1188,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130004-EPILOGUE:20718:9","scriptId":20718,"text":"然后奈特莉和鸵鸟玩起了斗鸡游戏，为芙琳和佩妮争取了大量的时间。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":1188,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:1","scriptId":20719,"text":"很快机场里的战车兽就清理干净了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":1188,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:2","scriptId":20719,"text":"虽然鸵鸟战车兽机动不错，但在几名钢舞姬的合围之下，最终还是被制伏了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":1188,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:3","scriptId":20719,"text":"这时通信器里传来了伊莎贝尔的呼叫。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":1188,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:4","scriptId":20719,"text":"“你们清理完机场内部的战车兽以后火速来门口支援。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":1187,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:5","scriptId":20719,"text":"“知道了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:6","scriptId":20719,"text":"听伊莎贝尔的口气，好像事态有变，于是赶忙通知佩妮她们。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:7","scriptId":20719,"text":"“机场内部的压制已经完成的话就过来集合，剩余的善后交给机场守卫处理。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:8","scriptId":20719,"text":"带着集合的钢舞姬立刻赶往伊莎贝尔所在的机场入口——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:9","scriptId":20719,"text":"“好家伙……这可是哪家动物园的鸵鸟馆爆仓了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:10","scriptId":20719,"text":"只见好几排鸵鸟战车兽正在和轮番和伊莎贝尔她们交战，数量至少超过了三十只。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:11","scriptId":20719,"text":"“马上支援，我们绕过去从侧面突击。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:12","scriptId":20719,"text":"“不，刚才我观察了下，鸵鸟群对爆炸声特别敏感，你们分散以后从多处同时使用高爆弹，定能弄乱它们的阵型。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:13","scriptId":20719,"text":"“哦？长官那么快就发现它们的弱点了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-PROLOGUE:20719:14","scriptId":20719,"text":"“别佩服了，开始执行任务吧，伊莎贝尔那边已经撑不了多久了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130005-EPILOGUE:20720:0","scriptId":20720,"text":"于是小队散开行动，在一轮高爆弹的轰炸下，那些鸵鸟果然一下子没了方向。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130005-EPILOGUE:20720:1","scriptId":20720,"text":"面对同时多个方向的爆炸，鸵鸟群的选择是慌乱撤退，机场的危机被解除了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-EPILOGUE:20720:2","scriptId":20720,"text":"“打得不错，刚才的多方向突袭真是个绝妙的威吓手段。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-EPILOGUE:20720:3","scriptId":20720,"text":"“过奖了，鸵鸟这种胆小的生物即使变成了战车兽，习性还是没有改变，让它们失去安全感以后立刻就溃散了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-EPILOGUE:20720:4","scriptId":20720,"text":"“这套理论你该去课堂上给那群菜鸟指挥官讲讲，我们桑赫斯特随时欢迎。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-EPILOGUE:20720:5","scriptId":20720,"text":"“我也就是实战经验多点，很多问题都是急中生智而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-EPILOGUE:20720:6","scriptId":20720,"text":"“也对，安逸的环境确实无法造就优秀的指挥官，我以后会多安排点实习课的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-EPILOGUE:20720:7","scriptId":20720,"text":"（啊……好像一不小心给桑赫斯特的学员们增加了额外的负担……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-EPILOGUE:20720:8","scriptId":20720,"text":"“我们接下来会追踪那批鸵鸟，这么大群的战车兽无论到哪儿都是非常大的威胁。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-EPILOGUE:20720:9","scriptId":20720,"text":"“我们也去吧，反正前一次任务算是提早结束，还有得是时间。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130005-EPILOGUE:20720:10","scriptId":20720,"text":"“很好，能多几个可靠的帮手是再好不过了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:0","scriptId":20721,"text":"一行人顺着鸵鸟逃跑的方向深入了丛林。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:2","scriptId":20721,"text":"大约在追踪了几个小时后，终于在一处类似废墟的地方发现了一只不妙的东西。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:3","scriptId":20721,"text":"“这东西……是骸虫！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:4","scriptId":20721,"text":"“嗯？骸虫……旅行者奴役的怪物吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:5","scriptId":20721,"text":"“没错……虽然样子稍微有点不同，但绝对没错。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:6","scriptId":20721,"text":"没想到会在这里看到骸虫，不由得让人倒抽一口冷气。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:7","scriptId":20721,"text":"这是一个危险的信号，或许会因此遇上旅行者，如果是兰布达之类的还好说，如若是其他人就非常不妙了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:8","scriptId":20721,"text":"可以看到鸵鸟和骸虫之间保持着相当的距离，像是在对峙着。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:9","scriptId":20721,"text":"随着其中一只鸵鸟的一声大叫，那群鸵鸟四散奔逃了，完全没有了之前的组织性。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1194,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:10","scriptId":20721,"text":"“怎么那么吵？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1194,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:11","scriptId":20721,"text":"从废墟的一侧走出来一个小女孩，而就她的衣着来看就知道一定大有来头。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1194,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:12","scriptId":20721,"text":"“不妙，真的是旅行者……并且还是我不认识的家伙……”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1194,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:13","scriptId":20721,"text":"“旅行者？？那接下来该怎么办？”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:14","scriptId":20721,"text":"“最好不要发出声响，能够偷偷离开她的观察范围是最好的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:15","scriptId":20721,"text":"然而事情和所期望的方向背道而驰，那个旅行者对着草丛的一侧说道。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1194,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:16","scriptId":20721,"text":"“怎么还来了一群钢舞姬？难道是刚才的那群傻鸟引来的？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1194,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:17","scriptId":20721,"text":"旅行者刚说完，她身边就出现了几只骸虫还有嵌合战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1194,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:18","scriptId":20721,"text":"“这下麻烦了……这嵌合战车兽果然和旅行者有关系……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1194,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:19","scriptId":20721,"text":"不得已只能离开隐蔽的草丛——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1194,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:20","scriptId":20721,"text":"“哟，是旅行者啊，没想到还能在这里看到呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1194,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:21","scriptId":20721,"text":"虽然话说得很轻巧，但其实只是为了试探对方的口风。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1194,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:22","scriptId":20721,"text":"然而对方的反应好像并不友善的样子。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1194,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1194,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:23","scriptId":20721,"text":"“哦？竟然知道星团？不，不对，你就是兰布达口中的特级目标吧？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1194,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:24","scriptId":20721,"text":"“你认识兰布达？那就好说了，我们只是在追赶鸵鸟战车兽的时候路过了这里。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1194,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1195,"speaker":"欧米伽","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:25","scriptId":20721,"text":"“少跟我套近乎，我欧米伽可不打算跟人类和平共处，入侵我的养殖场就等着受死吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-PROLOGUE:20721:26","scriptId":20721,"text":"欧米伽一抬手，那几只骸虫和嵌合战车兽就朝着众人扑来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:1","scriptId":20722,"text":"在旅行者、骸虫和嵌合战车兽的围攻下，众人边战边退。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:2","scriptId":20722,"text":"“那个旅行者是怎么回事，怎么都没讲几句就开打了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:3","scriptId":20722,"text":"“欧米伽……虽然我不认识她，但她好像认识我，这就说明她很可能是泰莱塔那边的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:4","scriptId":20722,"text":"“如果是兰布达之类的话，我们肯定还能沟通。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:5","scriptId":20722,"text":"“虽然体型和兰布达差不多，但我看这个欧米伽有点阴森，不太像能沟通的类型。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:6","scriptId":20722,"text":"“这次是意外遭遇，我们没有准备，直接开打对我们非常不利。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:7","scriptId":20722,"text":"“特别是在不知道欧米伽能力的情况下，贸然进攻很可能会出问题，现在还是以撤退为主。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:8","scriptId":20722,"text":"“在旅行者这方面你们小队是权威级的，我相信你们，全员撤退。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:9","scriptId":20722,"text":"“嗯，如果没猜错的话，那些嵌合战车兽多半就是欧米伽的杰作。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:10","scriptId":20722,"text":"“这样一个小女孩就是旅行者？我还是第一次见到活的呢，看上去也就是服装有点怪异而已嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:11","scriptId":20722,"text":"“人不可貌相，她们的特殊能力大都可以颠覆战局，如果不搞清楚是绝对无法战胜她们的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:12","scriptId":20722,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:13","scriptId":20722,"text":"“差不多要脱离双方交战的极限距离了，准备烟雾弹。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:14","scriptId":20722,"text":"“烟雾弹填装，准备发射。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130006-EPILOGUE:20722:15","scriptId":20722,"text":"在一轮烟雾弹齐射过后，众人加大马力一口气冲出了森林，以极快地速度离开了战场。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
